#: website/templates/website/base.html:28
#: website/templates/website/base.html:57
msgid "About"
msgstr "Biz haqimizda"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:4
msgid ""
"Learn about Suzuki Fumiko and her mission to bring Japanese deep lymph care "
"to Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"Suzuki Fumiko va uning Yaponiya chuqur limfa parvarishini O'zbekistonga olib "
"kelish missiyasi haqida bilib oling."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:10
msgid "About FUMIHEALING:"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: haqida"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:11
msgid "A story of healing that crosses borders."
msgstr "Chegaralarni kesib o'tuvchi davolash hikoyasi."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:22
msgid "years Japan"
msgstr "yil Yaponiya"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:26
msgid "Founder"
msgstr "Asoschi"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:27
#: website/templates/website/contact.html:103
msgid "Suzuki Fumiko"
msgstr "Suzuki Fumiko"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:30
msgid ""
"Hello. I am Fumiko Suzuki, representative of FOLIYA JAPAN in Uzbekistan. I "
"worked as a practitioner and educator in Japan for 17 years. And now I have "
"come to Uzbekistan for a reason."
msgstr ""
"Assalomu alaykum. Men Fumiko Suzuki, O'zbekistonda FOLIYA JAPAN vakili. Men "
"Yaponiyada 17 yil davomida amaliyotchi va o'qituvchi sifatida ishlagan. Va "
"hozir O'zbekistonga kelishimning sababi bor."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:33
msgid ""
"I felt that there is a wonderful massage culture in this country. Uzbekistan "
"has its own unique strengths, and Japan has its own healing approach. I "
"wanted to bring Japan's 'balancing' technique here — and that is why I "
"created this course."
msgstr ""
"Men bu mamlakatda ajoyib massaj madaniyati mavjudligini his qildim. "
"O'zbekistonda o'ziga xos yaxshi jihatlar bor, Yaponiyada esa o'ziga xos "
"davolash yondashuvi mavjud. Men Yaponiyaning 'muvozanatlash' texnikasini shu "
"yerda yetkazmoqchi edim — shuning uchun ushbu kursni tashkil qildim."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:36
msgid ""
"There is no national border when it comes to touching the human body. We are "
"united in our desire to improve the lives of those in front of us."
msgstr ""
"Inson tanasiga teginishda millat chegarasi yo'q. Biz ko'z o'ngimizdagi "
"odamlarning hayotini yaxshilash istagida bir xilmiz."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:47
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Our Story"
msgid "Our Journey"
msgstr "Bizning hikoyamiz"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:48
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Tashkent, Uzbekistan"
msgid "From Japan to Uzbekistan"
msgstr "Toshkent, O'zbekiston"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:51
msgid "17 years of Japanese practice. One mission across borders."
msgstr "17 yillik Yapon amaliyoti. Chegaralar bo'ylab bitta missiya."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:58
msgid "2008 — 2024"
msgstr "2008 — 2024"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:59
msgid "17 Years of Mastery in Japan"
msgstr "Yaponiyada 17 yillik mahorat"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:60
msgid ""
"Suzuki Fumiko builds her practice in Japan as both a certified therapist and "
"educator — specialising in deep lymphatic care, shiatsu, and the Japanese "
"philosophy of balance (整える). She teaches across schools and private "
"practice, refining the FUMIHEALING: method."
msgstr "Suzuki Fumiko Yaponiyada sertifikatlangan terapevt va o'qituvchi sifatida amaliyotini rivojlantiradi — chuqur limfa parvarishi, shiatsu va yapon muvozanat falsafasi (整える) bo'yicha ixtisoslashadi. U maktablar va xususiy amaliyotda dars beradi, FUMIHEALING: usulini takomillashtiradi."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:65
msgid "2024"
msgstr "2024"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:66
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Tashkent, Uzbekistan"
msgid "Arrival in Uzbekistan"
msgstr "Toshkent, O'zbekiston"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:67
msgid ""
"Fumiko arrives in Uzbekistan and discovers a rich massage culture unlike "
"anywhere she had seen. She feels an immediate connection — the warmth of the "
"people, the openness to healing. She decides: this is where the next chapter "
"begins."
msgstr "Fumiko O'zbekistonga keladi va ilgari hech qaerda ko'rmagan boy massaj madaniyatini kashf etadi. U odamlarning iliqligini, davolashga ochiqligini his qiladi. Va qaror qiladi: keyingi bob shu yerdan boshlanadi."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:72
msgid "10 September 2025"
msgstr "10 Sentabr 2025"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:73
msgid "FOLIYA JAPAN Officially Founded"
msgstr "FOLIYA JAPAN rasman tashkil etildi"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:74
msgid "\\"
msgstr ""

#: website/templates/website/about.html:79
msgid "2025"
msgstr "2025"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:80
msgid "First Courses & ON FLOW School Launches"
msgstr "Birinchi kurslar va ON FLOW Maktabi ishga tushdi"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:81
msgid ""
"The first FUMIHEALING: training courses are held for Uzbek therapists and "
"massage schools. ON FLOW Lymph Salon & School opens — teaching not just "
"technique, but the Japanese spirit of omotenashi. The FUMIHEALING: UZBEK "
"TEAM begins to form."
msgstr "O'zbek terapevtlari va massaj maktablari uchun birinchi FUMIHEALING: o'quv kurslari o'tkazildi. ON FLOW Limfa Saloni va Maktabi ochildi — faqat texnikani emas, balki omotenashining yapon ruhini o'rgatadi. FUMIHEALING: UZBEK TEAM shakllana boshladi."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:86
msgid "2026 & Beyond"
msgstr "2026 va undan keyin"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:87
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Building trust"
msgid "Building the Future"
msgstr "Ishonch qurish"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:88
msgid ""
"The mission continues: training high-quality therapists, expanding "
"partnerships with massage schools across Uzbekistan, and building a future "
"where people say — 'There are wonderful therapists in Uzbekistan too.'"
msgstr "Missiya davom etmoqda: yuqori sifatli terapevtlarni tayyorlash, O'zbekiston bo'ylab massaj maktablari bilan hamkorlikni kengaytirish va 'O'zbekistonda ham ajoyib terapevtlar bor' deyiladigan kelajakni qurish."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:101
msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "Bizning vazifamiz"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:102
msgid "Why Uzbekistan?"
msgstr "Nima uchun O'zbekiston?"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:104
msgid ""
"I came to Uzbekistan to spread Japanese-style deep lymph care. My goal is "
"not simply to teach technique."
msgstr ""
"Men Yapon uslubidagi chuqur limfa parvarishini O'zbekistonda rivojlantirish "
"uchun bu mamlakatga keldim. Mening maqsadim faqat texnikani o'rgatish emas."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:105
msgid ""
"I want to create a future here together where women can gain a skill and "
"live by their own strength."
msgstr ""
"Men bu yerda: 'Ayollar hunar egallab, o'z kuchi bilan yashay oladigan "
"kelajak'ni birgalikda yaratishni istayman."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:106
msgid ""
"I believe Uzbekistan is a country that will develop greatly in the coming "
"years. As the economy grows and society changes, women's ways of working and "
"living will gradually change too. At the same time, fatigue will certainly "
"accumulate in people's hearts and bodies. That is why I believe the "
"'therapist' will become one of the most needed professions of the coming era."
msgstr ""
"Kelajakda O'zbekiston katta rivojlanishga erishadigan davlat bo'lishiga "
"ishonaman. Iqtisodiyot o'sadi, jamiyat o'zgaradi, ayollarning ishlash va "
"yashash tarzi ham asta-sekin o'zgarib boradi. Shu bilan birga, insonlarning "
"qalbi va tanasida charchoq ham paydo bo'ladi. Shuning uchun men kelajakda "
"eng kerakli kasblardan biri — 'terapevt' kasbi bo'ladi deb o'ylayman."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:118
msgid "Our Values"
msgstr "Bizning qadriyatlarimiz"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:119
msgid "What we carry across borders"
msgstr "Biz chegaralar bo'ylab olib o'tadigan narsa"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:124
msgid "Japanese Omotenashi"
msgstr "Yapon omotenashi ruhi"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:125
msgid ""
"We teach not just technique, but the spirit: valuing clients, showing care, "
"attentiveness, sensitivity, and building trust."
msgstr ""
"Biz faqat texnikani emas, balki ruhni ham o'rgatamiz: mijozni qadrlash, "
"g'amxo'rlik ko'rsatish, e'tibor, noziklik va ishonch qurish."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:129
msgid "Women's Empowerment"
msgstr "Ayollarni kuchaytirish"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:130
msgid ""
"We want students to work in FUMIHEALING: salons, become independent, support "
"their families, and change their lives."
msgstr ""
"Biz o'quvchilar FUMIHEALING: salonlarida ishlashi, mustaqil bo'lishi, "
"oilalarini qo'llab-quvvatlashi va o'z hayotini o'zgartira olishini istaymiz."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:134
msgid "Cultural Bridge"
msgstr "Madaniy ko'prik"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:135
msgid ""
"Different languages, different cultures — yet the desire to heal people's "
"bodies and hearts knows no borders."
msgstr ""
"Turli tillar, turli madaniyatlar — biroq odamlarning tana va qalbini "
"davolash istagi hech qanday chegara bilmaydi."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:144
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Kelajak ko'rinishi"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:145
msgid "1–2 years from now"
msgstr "1–2 yildan keyin"

#: website/templates/website/about.html:148
msgid ""
"I want to create a future where people say: 'There are also wonderful "
"therapists in Uzbekistan.'"
msgstr ""
"Men 'O'zbekistonda ham juda yaxshi terapevtlar bor' deb aytiladigan "
"kelajakni yaratishni istayman."

#: website/templates/website/about.html:151
#: website/templates/website/contact.html:102
msgid ""
"I see great possibilities in Uzbekistan's future. That is precisely why I "
"decided to start here, at this moment."
msgstr ""
"Men O'zbekiston kelajagida katta imkoniyatlarni ko'ryapman. Shuning uchun "
"aynan hozir, shu yerdan boshlashga qaror qildim."

