msgstr "Chuqur teginish san'ati"

#: website/templates/website/home.html:83
msgid ""
"Every session is a moment of balance — not force, not speed, but presence "
"and precision."
msgstr "Har bir seans muvozanat lahzasi — kuch emas, tezlik emas, balki mavjudlik va aniqlik."

