msgid "Learn More"
msgstr "Ko'proq bilish"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:3
msgid "The Method"
msgstr "Usul"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:4
msgid ""
"Learn about the FUMIHEALING: deep lymph care method — balance, depth, and "
"the Japanese approach to healing."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: chuqur limfa parvarishi usuli haqida bilib oling — muvozanat, "
"chuqurlik va davolashning yapon yondashuvi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:10
msgid "The FUMIHEALING: Method"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: Usuli"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:11
msgid "Not force. Not just drainage. True balance."
msgstr "Kuch emas. Faqat oqizish ham emas. Haqiqiy muvozanat."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:19
#: website/templates/website/school.html:59
msgid "Philosophy"
msgstr "Falsafa"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:20
msgid "What is Japanese-style lymph care?"
msgstr "Yapon uslubidagi limfa parvarishi nima?"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:23
msgid ""
"Japanese style is not about using force, nor is it simply about continuously "
"draining fluid. For us, the most important concept is 'balance'."
msgstr ""
"Yapon uslubi — kuch ishlatish emas, faqat uzluksiz oqizib davom etish ham "
"emas. Biz uchun eng muhimi — 'muvozanatlash' tushunchasidir."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:26
msgid ""
"In Japan, since ancient times, correcting posture, regulating breathing, and "
"balancing internal systems have been considered essential. The essence of "
"the Japanese approach is balancing the internal state, not the external."
msgstr ""
"Yaponiyada qadimdan holatni to'g'rilash, nafasni tartibga solish va ichki "
"tizimni muvozanatlash muhim hisoblanadi. Tashqi emas, ichki holatni "
"muvozanatlash — bu yapon uslubining mohiyatidir."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:29
msgid "We do not drain. We balance — and the body flows naturally on its own."
msgstr ""
"Biz oqizmaymiz. Biz muvozanatlashtiramiz — va tana o'z-o'zidan tabiiy "
"ravishda oqadi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:44
msgid "The Difference"
msgstr "Farq"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:45
msgid "Why deep matters"
msgstr "Nima uchun chuqurlik muhim"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:47
msgid ""
"Most lymph care methods target only the surface layer. This creates "
"temporary relief — but the problem returns quickly."
msgstr ""
"Ko'p limfa parvarishi usullari faqat yuzaki qatlamga ta'sir qiladi. Bu "
"vaqtinchalik yengillik yaratadi — ammo muammo tezda qaytadi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:48
msgid ""
"The lymph blockage causes are deep: muscle tension, postural imbalance, "
"shallow breathing, internal organ fatigue, nervous system dysregulation."
msgstr ""
"Limfa tiqilishining sabablari chuqurda: mushak tarangligi, holat buzilishi, "
"yuzaki nafas, ichki a'zolar charchashi, asab tizimi buzilishi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:49
msgid ""
"By working the deep layer, muscles release, breathing changes, and flow "
"naturally improves. The change becomes lasting, not temporary."
msgstr ""
"Chuqur qatlamga ishlash orqali mushaklar bo'shaydi, nafas o'zgaradi va oqim "
"tabiiy ravishda yaxshilanadi. O'zgarish doimiy bo'ladi, vaqtinchalik emas."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:61
msgid "Comparison"
msgstr "Taqqoslash"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:62
msgid "FUMIHEALING: vs other approaches"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: va boshqa usullar"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:67
msgid "Other Styles"
msgstr "Boshqa uslublar"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:73
msgid "Relaxation — pleasant sensation, temporary change"
msgstr "Relaksatsiya — yoqimli his, vaqtinchalik o'zgarish"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:74
msgid "Structural change — lasting results"
msgstr "Tuzilmaviy o'zgarish — doimiy natija"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:77
msgid "Targets superficial layer"
msgstr "Yuzaki qatlamga yo'naltirilgan"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:78
msgid "Works the deep layer"
msgstr "Chuqur qatlamga ishlaydi"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:81
msgid "Drain first, then relax"
msgstr "Avval oqizish, keyin bo'shashish"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:82
msgid "Balance first, then flow"
msgstr "Avval muvozanatlash, keyin oqizish"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:85
msgid "Oil massage — sliding technique"
msgstr "Yog'li massaj — sirpantirib oqizish texnikasi"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:86
msgid "Shiatsu + lymph — point & area combined"
msgstr "Shiatsu + limfa — nuqta va maydon birlashtirilgan"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:89
msgid "Effect fades quickly"
msgstr "Ta'sir tezda yo'qoladi"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:90
msgid "The body learns a new, healthy state"
msgstr "Tana yangi, sog'lom holatni o'rganadi"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:102
msgid "Technique"
msgstr "Texnika"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:103
msgid "Why we pause — and wait"
msgstr "Nima uchun to'xtatib — kutamiz"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:105
msgid "The body does not change the moment pressure is applied."
msgstr "Tana, ta'sir berilgan zahoti darhol o'zgarmaydi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:109
msgid "Muscles need time to release"
msgstr "Mushak bo'shashishi uchun vaqt kerak"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:110
msgid ""
"Rushing past this moment means the next touch lands before the body has "
"responded."
msgstr ""
"Bu momentni o'tkazib yuborish — tana reaksiyaga kirishmasdan keyingi ta'sir "
"beriladi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:115
msgid "Breathing needs time to shift"
msgstr "Nafas o'zgarishi uchun vaqt kerak"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:116
msgid ""
"A change in breath is a change in the whole nervous system — and that "
"requires space."
msgstr ""
"Nafasdagi o'zgarish — butun asab tizimidagi o'zgarish — bu esa makon talab "
"qiladi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:121
msgid "The nervous system needs time to respond"
msgstr "Asab tizimi reaksiyasi uchun vaqt kerak"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:122
msgid ""
"When we apply pressure and wait, the body begins to change in that interval. "
"This 'gap' is where real transformation happens."
msgstr ""
"Bosim berib, biroz kutilganda, tana o'sha oraliqda o'zgarishni boshlaydi. Bu "
"'oraliq' — haqiqiy o'zgarish sodir bo'ladigan joy."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:127
msgid "Apply pressure. Then wait. In that pause, the body begins to change."
msgstr "Bosim bering. Keyin kuting. O'sha pauzada tana o'zgarishni boshlaydi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:140
msgid "Shiatsu"
msgstr "Shiatsu"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:141
msgid "The role of shiatsu"
msgstr "Shiatsu roli"

#: website/templates/website/method.html:144
msgid ""
"In FUMIHEALING:, shiatsu is not a pressure technique — it is a balancing "
"technique. Lymph drainage works across areas (surface); shiatsu works at "
"points (depth). By combining area and point, the body's transformation "
"deepens."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: da shiatsu bosish texnikasi emas — bu muvozanatlash texnikasi. "
"Limfa drenaji maydonlar bo'yicha ishlaydi (yuzaki); shiatsu nuqtalar orqali "
"ishlaydi (chuqurlik). Maydon va nuqtani birlashtirib, tananing o'zgarishi "
"chuqurlashadi."

#: website/templates/website/method.html:146
msgid "Learn This Method"
msgstr "Bu usulni o'rganing"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:4
msgid ""
"Train as a FUMIHEALING: therapist. Learn Japanese deep lymph care in "
"Uzbekistan."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: terapevti sifatida o'qing. O'zbekistonda Yapon uslubidagi "
"chuqur limfa parvarishini o'rganing."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:10
msgid "FUMIHEALING: School"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: Maktabi"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:11
msgid "Training high-quality therapists in Uzbekistan."
msgstr "O'zbekistonda yuqori sifatli terapevtlarni tayyorlash."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:19
msgid "Training"
msgstr "Tayyorlov"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:20
msgid "More than technique — a calling"
msgstr "Texnikadan ko'proq — bu chaqiriq"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:23
msgid ""
"FUMIHEALING: is not just a massage method. It is a career path and a life "
"skill. We train therapists who can work independently, support their "
"families, and make a meaningful difference in the lives of their clients."
msgstr ""
"FUMIHEALING: faqat massaj usuli emas. Bu martaba yo'li va hayotiy mahorat. "
"Biz mustaqil ishlay oladigan, oilalarini qo'llab-quvvatlay oladigan va "
"mijozlar hayotida muhim farq yarata oladigan terapevtlarni tayyorlaymiz."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:26
msgid ""
"Our school teaches the full FUMIHEALING: method: philosophy, lymph theory, "
"practical technique, and the Japanese spirit of omotenashi (hospitality)."
msgstr ""
"Bizning maktabimiz to'liq FUMIHEALING: usulini o'rgatadi: falsafa, limfa "
"nazariyasi, amaliy texnika va omotenashi (mehmondo'stlik) yapon ruhi."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:31
msgid "hour course"
msgstr "soatlik kurs"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:35
msgid "modules"
msgstr "modul"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:39
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Languages"
msgid "languages"
msgstr "Tillar"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:53
msgid "Curriculum"
msgstr "O'quv dasturi"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:54
msgid "What you will learn"
msgstr "Nima o'rganasiz"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:60
msgid ""
"What is Japanese style? The essence of deep lymph care. How FUMIHEALING: "
"differs from other methods."
msgstr ""
"Yapon uslubi nima? Chuqur limfa parvarishining mohiyati. FUMIHEALING: boshqa "
"usullardan qanday farq qiladi."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:64
msgid "Theory"
msgstr "Nazariya"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:65
msgid ""
"Lymph flow. Why blockage occurs. Why depth matters. The relationship between "
"muscle, bone, and lymph."
msgstr ""
"Limfa oqimi. Nima uchun tiqilib qoladi. Nima uchun chuqurlik kerak. Mushak, "
"suyak va limfa o'rtasidagi munosabat."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:69
msgid "Demonstration"
msgstr "Namoyish"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:70
msgid ""
"Watch live massage. Observe how the body changes through the décolleté and "
"neck. Feel the difference yourself."
msgstr ""
"Jonli massajni tomosha qiling. Dekolte va bo'yin orqali tanada qanday "
"o'zgarish bo'lishini kuzating. Farqni o'zingiz his qiling."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:74
msgid "Practical ①"
msgstr "Amaliyot ①"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:75
msgid ""
"Décolleté and neck. Learn the 'stopping sensation' and correct pressure "
"method. The foundation of the technique."
msgstr ""
"Dekolte va bo'yin. 'To'xtash hissi' va to'g'ri bosim usulini o'rganamiz. "
"Texnikaning asosi."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:79
msgid "Practical ②"
msgstr "Amaliyot ②"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:80
msgid ""
"Connect décolleté → arms → neck into one continuous flow. Points become "
"lines, lines become a system."
msgstr ""
"Dekolte → qo'l → bo'ynini bir uzluksiz oqimga bog'lang. Nuqtalar "
"chiziqlarga, chiziqlar tizimga aylanadi."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:84
msgid "Full Practice"
msgstr "To'liq amaliyot"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:85
msgid ""
"Partner work. Full session from start to finish. The goal is not perfection "
"— it is confidence and the ability to do."
msgstr ""
"Juftlikda mashq. Boshdan oxirigacha to'liq seans. Maqsad mukammallik emas — "
"ishonch va qila olish hissidir."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:95
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Technique"
msgid "See the technique"
msgstr "Texnika"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:104
msgid "Décolleté"
msgstr "Dekolte"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:108
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Balance First"
msgid "Balance"
msgstr "Avval muvozanat"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:123
msgid "Spirit"
msgstr "Ruh"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:124
msgid "Beyond technique: omotenashi"
msgstr "Texnikadan tashqari: omotenashi"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:126
msgid ""
"We teach not just how to touch — but how to care. These qualities are the "
"heart of the Japanese healing tradition:"
msgstr ""
"Biz faqat qanday teginishni emas — balki qanday g'amxo'rlik qilishni "
"o'rgatamiz. Bu fazilatlar yapon davolash an'anasining yuragi:"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:128
msgid "Valuing your client"
msgstr "Mijozingizni qadrlash"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:128
msgid "Every client's wellbeing is your purpose."
msgstr "Har bir mijozning farovonligi sizning maqsadingiz."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:129
msgid "Empathy and consideration"
msgstr "Empatiya va e'tibor"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:129
msgid "Understanding the person in front of you, not just their body."
msgstr "Ko'z o'ngingizda turgan odamni, nafaqat uning tanasini tushunish."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:130
msgid "Gentleness and sensitivity"
msgstr "Muloyimlik va noziklik"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:130
msgid "Delicacy in every movement, every touch."
msgstr "Har bir harakat, har bir teginishda nafislik."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:131
msgid "Building trust"
msgstr "Ishonch qurish"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:131
msgid "A therapist clients return to again and again."
msgstr "Mijozlar qayta-qayta qaytib keladigan terapevt."

#: website/templates/website/school.html:144
msgid "Join Us"
msgstr "Bizga qo'shiling"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:145
msgid "Become a FUMIHEALING: UZBEK TEAM member"
msgstr "FUMIHEALING: UZBEK TEAM a'zosi bo'ling"

#: website/templates/website/school.html:148
msgid ""
"Whether you are already a massage therapist or just beginning, we welcome "
"you. Let's build the future of therapy in Uzbekistan together."
msgstr ""
"Siz allaqachon massaj terapevtimisiz yoki endigina boshlamoqchimisiz — sizni "
"qabul qilamiz. Keling, O'zbekistondagi terapiya kelajagini birga quraqmiz."

