msgid "The Essence of Japan"
msgstr "Yaponiya mohiyati"

msgid "You will feel like you are in Japan"
msgstr "O'zingizni Yaponiyada his qilasiz"

msgid "Fumiko brings the spirit of Japan to every session — the stillness, the precision, and the warmth of genuine care."
msgstr "Fumiko har bir seansga Yaponiya ruhini olib keladi — tinchlik, aniqlik va chin g'amxo'rlikning issiqligi."

msgid "In harmony with nature"
msgstr "Tabiat bilan uyg'unlikda"

msgid "Feel the nature. Feel yourself."
msgstr "Tabiatni his qiling. O'zingizni his qiling."

msgid "When we return to what is natural — the breath, the flow, the quiet — the body remembers how to heal."
msgstr "Tabiiylikkka qaytganimizda — nafas, oqim, tinchlik — tana qanday davolanishni esga oladi."
